# Working tree is LF on EVERY OS. This repo travels between Mac and Windows
# (exFAT external drive, multiple machines); without this, a Windows checkout
# rewrites every file to CRLF and git reports all-modified with zero real
# changes — which already cost one debugging round on 2026-07-27.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch line endings
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.mov binary
*.mp4 binary
*.MP4 binary
*.MOV binary
*.zip binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.psd binary
*.pages binary
